# A-25 · Trivy suppressions — NFR-SEC-07
#
# RULE: every entry carries an expiry date and a ticket id (FolderStructure.md §2).
# An entry without both is removed by review, not renewed. An expired entry
# fails the security workflow rather than silently continuing to suppress.
#
# Format:
#   CVE-YYYY-NNNNN exp:YYYY-MM-DD ticket:TD-NNN  # one line on why it cannot be fixed yet
#
# Empty by design. Nothing is suppressed until something is proven
# unfixable-for-now, and that proof is a TECH_DEBT.md entry.
